        "text": "Thank you <@U013ZLJARC7> for sharing! Just a little TLDR: I'm talking about my work and process in the field of data driven art and generative design (not GenAI) from seed of the idea, though initial visualisations and debug view art to final polished UI and outputs. There is a bit of art, a bit of nature a bit about Nodes (my studio Visual Programming Environment) and branding and design. 130 slides in 36min.",
